msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Well, if it ain't Kishimoto-san. Come all this way to see me, now? I'm "
"touched."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "And who do we have here? Haven't seen you 'round before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Kiryu. You could say I'm friends with Kishimoto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"So what can I do for ya? If ya want a loan, I'll give you the same rate I "
"gave Kishimoto: 10％ every ten days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Well, that explains a lot. Don't you think that's a little absurd?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Are ya tryin' to pick a fight? If you got a problem, buddy, take it up with "
"my employees!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Hey, guys! This man here'd like to have a chat with ya!"
msgstr ""

